				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quarta pars (urbis),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Verr. 2, 4, 53, § 119</span></i>
			 Zumpt <i>N. cr.</i> (al. aedificata).</div>
